flowchart TD
MOO_Controller["**MOO_Controller**<br/>Optimizes buffer capacities to minimize WIP and maximize Throughput"]
PopulationManager["**PopulationManager**<br/>Attributes population list methods initialize mutate select evaluate"]
CandidateSolution["**CandidateSolution**<br/>Attributes buffer_caps for buffers capacities {1-5} methods encode decode apply"]
SelectionOperator["**SelectionOperator**<br/>Performs parent selection by tournament or ranking"]
VariationOperator["**VariationOperator**<br/>Applies crossover and mutation ensures capacities in {1-5}"]
Scheduler["**Scheduler**<br/>Dispatches simulation jobs possibly parallel manages random seeds"]
SimulatorInterface["**SimulatorInterface**<br/>Adapter for original simulation code method run simulation with buffer_caps and seed"]
RunSimulationFunction["**RunSimulationFunction**<br/>Wrapper around original run_simulation returns metrics for a run"]
SystemModelBuffers["**SystemModelBuffers**<br/>Defines buffers PostLoadingBuffer PostConveyorBuffer PostWashingBuffer PrePress1Buffer PrePress2Buffer PostPress1_2Buffer capacities {1-5}"]
MetricsCollector["**MetricsCollector**<br/>Collects throughput wip produced_parts and machine energy per run"]
ObjectiveEvaluator["**ObjectiveEvaluator**<br/>Computes objective vector WIP to minimize Throughput to maximize"]
ParetoArchive["**ParetoArchive**<br/>Stores non dominated CandidateSolution objects updates Pareto front"]
UserInterface["**UserInterface**<br/>Manager sets constraints budget and stop criteria visualizes Pareto front"]

